# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored; this template must never hold real keys.
# Loaded by `npm run dev|sync|eval` and gateway.sh via node --env-file-if-exists.
# Nothing here is required: with no keys set the gateway runs lexical-only.

# --- Embeddings -------------------------------------------------------------
# Remote. Setting this key is the opt-in that sends turn text off-machine,
# a deliberate departure from spec §73 Principle 5 (local-first).
VOYAGE_API_KEY=
# Model and width are configuration because several Voyage models share a width
# and a wrong pairing would write a foreign vector space into a valid-looking
# table. The provider asserts the returned width matches and throws if not.
# VOYAGE_MODEL=voyage-4
# VOYAGE_DIM=1024
# VOYAGE_CODE_MODEL=voyage-code-4
# VOYAGE_CODE_DIM=1024
# VOYAGE_TIMEOUT_MS=30000

# Pin one engine instead of the default order (voyage -> mlx -> ollama).
# A pinned engine never falls back, so one corpus cannot scatter across tables.
# mlx requires Apple Silicon and cannot run on an Intel Mac.
# GATEWAY_EMBED_ENGINE=voyage

# --- Vector storage ---------------------------------------------------------
# lance | sqlite. Default probes for the LanceDB native addon and uses
# sqlite-vec when it is absent, which is always the case on darwin-x64
# (LanceDB dropped Intel macOS after 0.22.3).
# GATEWAY_VECTOR_BACKEND=sqlite

# --- Jev / TypeSafe ---------------------------------------------------------
# Reranking. Setting this key makes Jev the selected reranker, but reranking
# still never runs unless a request passes `rerank` (default off on every
# transport). Two deliberate acts are required before query text leaves the box.
# Measured on the fixture golden set: lexical 0.628 -> cross-encoder 0.702 ->
# jev 0.839 NDCG@5.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# Pin one reranker instead of the default order (jev -> cross-encoder). A pin
# never falls back, so a deployment cannot silently switch vendors.
# The cross-encoder is local, deterministic and rate-limit free (53ms/pair).
# GATEWAY_RERANKER=cross-encoder
# JEV_MODEL=jev-latest
# JEV_TIMEOUT_MS=30000

# --- Gateway server ---------------------------------------------------------
# Required to bind anything other than loopback; --host refuses without it.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
GATEWAY_TOKEN=
# GATEWAY_PORT=3000
# GATEWAY_ALLOWED_HOSTS=
# CONTEXT_GATEWAY_STATE=
# Everything below is also settable in <stateDir>/settings.json, which env
# deliberately outranks. Order: CLI flag > env > settings.json > default.
# GATEWAY_BACKEND=tantivy
# GATEWAY_INDEX_DIR=
# GATEWAY_VECTOR_DIR=
